  description: 'Young, promising sailor whose crew got seperated after pirates  raided
    his ship and sold everyone to different buyers. He spent a few months in this
    prison, entertaining people through violence and gorish spectacle shown inside
    the colosseum arena. His toughness and positive attitude is worthy of a captain
    and his determination to find his missing crew is unvavering. Some say that his
    arms are made of steel, hence why he keeps them wrapped, but what lies beneath
    those bandages only Dest knows. '
